```
from typing import Annotated
from kedi.typesafe import Probability
RefundProbability = Annotated[
    Probability,
    "Does the customer request a refund?",
]
```
> adapter: pydantic
> model: typesafe/jev-latest
[message] = Cancel the order and return my payment.
>> Evaluate <message>. Refund probability: [p: `RefundProbability`].
> if: `p > 0.9`:
  = high confidence
> else:
  = review required
